1
00:00:38,820 --> 00:00:41,220
You should have listened to your uncle, Lady Arano.

2
00:00:41,380 --> 00:00:43,900
We have unfinished business, you and I.

3
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:47,620
The Iberia still carries a full complement of BattleMechs,

4
00:00:47,660 --> 00:00:50,100
plus enough firepower to level a city.

5
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:53,620
And you know that it’s too late to withdraw your forces.

6
00:00:54,140 --> 00:01:00,100
When I reach Coromodir, I will drown your Restoration in a sea of fire.

7
00:01:00,580 --> 00:01:04,220
Every dog in Arano colors will die.

8
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:09,380
You took my son from me, Kamea.

9
00:01:09,380 --> 00:01:13,100
My hope for the future died with him.

10
00:01:14,660 --> 00:01:16,820
Now I'm killing yours.

